Package: engrampa-offline
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: himaps <himaps@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://mate-desktop.org
Description: Offline installer bundle for engrampa on Kylin V10 SP1
 Carries the engrampa main .deb plus the on-demand dependency closure
 (p7zip-full, zip, unzip, unar, cpio, ... and their recursive
 dependencies, essential/system packages excluded by blacklist).
 .
 The install script /usr/lib/engrampa-offline/install-offline.sh
 installs ONLY packages missing on the target and never upgrades or
 replaces anything already installed.
 面向离线麒麟 V10 SP1 的 engrampa 安装套件:主包 + 按需依赖闭包。
 安装脚本只装缺失包,绝不升级已安装的系统组件。
